<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five stocks fell, five rose and six were flat in 6.5-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday with the WIG 20 index down 0.5 percent to 1,504.4 points.</p>
<p>The remaining seven stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.7 percent in a 4.7-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
